{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b8c195caaba6d560ff322c973bfb53e0b82fb642353c3145e8dd4aee1ff16915", "ja": "（今日は撮影のため、アイドル達と海に来た。\n仕事とはいえ水鉄砲バトル、みんな楽しそうだったな）", "zh": "（今天为了拍摄，我和偶像们来到海边。\n虽说是工作，不过大家打水仗似乎打得很开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "be9769b85c7f00caf21e6d84bf8c67b6f51fc93352ab106330ae043eb5bf7ac3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お、お待たせしました。\nごめんなさい、なかなか髪が乾かなくて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让、让你久等了。\n不好意思，我的头发一直弄不干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "473ead9e553c9d375fd117d0ed4edae04aa3a5b85ef090f59366a21370e065cf", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。大丈夫だけど、\nそれより忘れ物はないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n没关系啦，倒是你，没有忘记东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "e888a0d8dc643257a5a51e89374b4c68bf0660b0a79fb6767da1333194609947", "ja": "は、はい！　大丈夫です……あの、それより……\n本当に、よ、よかったんでしょうか……？", "zh": "没、没有！不用担心……那个，我比较想问……\n那样真的可、可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "1d36ab91b98acd2bc9627037469444849b054dc1e0b69eb1c0ac7df3f5cc45ed", "ja": "今日は、お仕事だったのに……わ、私、\n思いっきりはしゃいでしまったので……うう。", "zh": "今天明明是来工作的……\n我、我却玩疯了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "259f10eb43010dd0bd6f534d1e53ae7181f3c0a40e01444db747a6d025a837f5", "ja": "もちろん、それも大丈夫だよ。いい画が撮れたって、\nカメラマンさんも言ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "当然没问题啊。\n摄影师不是也说拍到了很棒的画面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "c9497a73cbbf6cad6f88e6af3fcf5ab8a9f057b5356b3edb1917dd9b92a20087", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　よかったです……。\nでも……つ、次からは、気をつけますね……。", "zh": "真、真的吗？太好了……\n不过……下次我会注意的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "c61bba846de7a5facfee7cf97454c08e35e28e21fb9424bf7382ed67269efddc", "ja": "楽しくて、つい浮かれてしまって……お、\nお仕事だってこと、忘れないようにしなくちゃ……！", "zh": "玩得太开心，结果得意忘形……\n不、不能忘记，自己是来工作的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "421550a0a8177f5c5fee72f33e0df2ab5dba9af32124986a7828d57efc2b4b47", "ja": "そんなに反省しなくても……。それより可憐、\n散歩がしたかったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "不用这样深切反省啦……\n不说这个了，可怜，你不是想要散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eb3b32612e00bed34962f8e8fc281453bdde0233a5644620a7e592676f0c0164", "ja": "あまりのんびりしていると日が暮れてしまうから、\n少し急がないとな。行こうか。", "zh": "太慢吞吞的话天就要黑了，\n动作得快点才行，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "cdeb65437b8d27508b12870eeea9545d01f6d73ef85255a7227f4a08dbc75c37", "ja": "えっ？　で、でも、いいんですか……？　着替えて\n来てって言われたから、じ、時間がないのかと……。", "zh": "咦？不、不过，真的可以吗……？\n你叫我去换衣服，我、我还以为没时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a8a0c8bf553ce3cf89ef0592c7ce0f9327e811968e43fcbd77c4a4eacfa160c0", "ja": "それは、水びたしのままだと\n可憐が風邪を引きそうだったからだよ。", "zh": "那是因为一直全身湿答答的，\n你可能会感冒啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "ad8aaeef55f482c63a420d3d266664bab0a6d5a4af474822d22c42fcaacdf880", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nあ、ありがとうございます……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢、谢谢你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "863044e456129647e6b34096234a3b677dda4ef7015a4a7382f43af0e9ae265b", "ja": "今日は海に来られて……{$P$}さんと\nお散歩までできて、私、とってもうれしいです……。", "zh": "今天能来海边……还可以跟{$P$}先生\n一起散步，我真的好高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c36ad7525fa7beab5c2a7a8d66f5d81e9afd898b9310f8a5342a3895df71184e", "ja": "うん。確かに、見事な夕陽だもんな。\n可憐が散歩したいって言った気持ちもわかるよ。", "zh": "嗯，夕阳确实很美呢！\n我可以明白，可怜说想要散步的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "4cd838a210a90ecbd2415c9d4edd0e1532d4ecdc4cf5f0e2e0e21d202e0c747d", "ja": "はい……。わ、私の家は、両親が心配性で……\nひとりで海に入るのも、止められていたから……。", "zh": "是的……我、我父母很爱操心……\n所以都不准我一个人进到海里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "552d8975176cbfa5a4a59d6de8833e6e8a226d40031952370addec3229a40776", "ja": "でも、お仕事のおかげで……こんなに綺麗な夕焼けを\n見たり、楽しい思い出を作ることができました……。", "zh": "不过多亏这份工作……我才能看到这么美丽的夕阳，\n留下了一段快乐的回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "75e4c9c64cde04b2a9eb0bc2b48586d6f665c51b4d46b7c0119823125c6fa016", "ja": "それも、可憐が勇気を出してアイドルになったからだ。\n仕事だけど、楽しめたならよかった。", "zh": "这都是因为，可怜鼓起勇气当上了偶像啊。\n虽说这是工作，但你玩得开心的话，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "275e34ce922e1c835d89e901a67fb7b37387c18589366d3b51b8968ab5a9e093", "ja": "はい……！　し、潮の香りも、砂浜の感触も……\nとても、大切な思い出になりました……♪", "zh": "是……！海、海水的气味，还有沙滩的触感……\n都成为我宝贵的回忆了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0133_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "68313f1dfc79b99801fb831e363c0fd1adee90d92b1b2d414416750b836afc03", "ja": "{$P$}さん……これからも私を、\nい、いろんな場所に連れていってください……なんて♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……今后也请你，\n带、带我去许多不同的地方……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
